WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.312
Let’s walk through Diplomacy & Information PLI.

00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:07.037
Read diplomacy and information as a paired specialist result.

00:00:07.037 --> 00:00:10.562
Confirm both routed tracks cleared the specialist boundary and use

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:14.338
the finalized output as evidence rather than editing or recreating

00:00:14.338 --> 00:00:16.262
the decision in White Cell.

00:00:16.262 --> 00:00:19.587
On this slide, review the paired finalized diplomacy and

00:00:19.587 --> 00:00:21.188
information outputs.

00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:24.350
In practice, both tracks clear together at the specialist

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.312
boundary;

00:00:25.312 --> 00:00:28.975
White Cell sees the result after that boundary is satisfied

00:00:28.975 --> 00:00:29.137
.

00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:32.973
When you are ready, use Open Diplomacy & Information

00:00:32.973 --> 00:00:35.898
PLI to move to the live surface.

00:00:35.898 --> 00:00:38.610
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:38.760
.
